      "seed": 1343,
      "version": 695,
      "versionNonce": 2066616474,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1776338099058,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Phase 1-4: \n→Simulator writes SQL DB \n    → CES streams \n    → Event Hub \n        → Eventstream \n            → KQL \n            → Dashboard (30s)\n\nPhase 5: \nVariable Library spike_power_multiplier \n→ data spikes \n→ Activator fires Teams alert\n\nData Agent:\nQueries BOTH KQL (real-time energy) \nand Lakehouse (carbon, machine metadata)\nFabric → SQL: Managed Private Endpoint\nSQL → Event Hub: Public endpoint (current limitation)",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Phase 1-4: \n→Simulator writes SQL DB \n    → CES streams \n    → Event Hub \n        → Eventstream \n            → KQL \n            → Dashboard (30s)\n\nPhase 5: \nVariable Library spike_power_multiplier \n→ data spikes \n→ Activator fires Teams alert\n\nData Agent:\nQueries BOTH KQL (real-time energy) \nand Lakehouse (carbon, machine metadata)\nFabric → SQL: Managed Private Endpoint\nSQL → Event Hub: Public endpoint (current limitation)",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "bK6",
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "autoResize": true
    },
